<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 10.37 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 10.37 mln rand S.African bonds Fri.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 10.37 million rands worth of South African bonds on Friday after selling 39.87 million on Thursday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
